Error [E2933]: this line inside `form :: Layout.{ … }` doesn't produce a constraint (found `Bool`)
  --> tests/ui/layout_not_a_constraint.jet:6:9
    |
  6 |         x == 1
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: every element inside a `Layout.{ … }` body must be a `>=`/`<=`/`==` comparison of layout values (a `Constraint`)
 Fix: write a comparison, e.g. `label.width >= 80.0`, or capture it: `c :: label.width >= 80.0`
